{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"ee13a890424cd1b1515c93701ac1bde7809055809a44b7f7f33cebfc1c1790e0"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:8c6ed3b16fd45259d3eada87bfd844cee4ed847d88d8e0654ed7e728e1f345e4","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Last summer 2023","evidence":"[D26:23 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] John: Organizing a basketball camp for kids in my hometown last summer was an awesome experience! Seeing their faces light up when they hit the court was priceless. It was a week full of laughs, high-fives, and personal growth for us all. That opportunity to inspire those kids and show them just how much potential they have was truly incredible.","itemId":"urn:uuid:db268d4c-9602-5748-9138-4b57e974fa0e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ed3a99d48c2497e06043fcd1170f7242cdaf3f9f37692ed07f28a2a71f3c639a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John organize a basketball camp for kids?","referenceAnswer":"summer 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ed3a99d48c2497e06043fcd1170f7242cdaf3f9f37692ed07f28a2a71f3c639a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}